                </assert_contents>
            </output>
            <param name="savelog" value="true"/>
            <expand macro="logfile-test"/>
        </test>
    </tests>
    <help><![CDATA[

@MOTHUR_OVERVIEW@

**Command Documentation**

The phylotype_ command assign sequences to OTUs based on their taxonomy and outputs a a list_, a sabund_ (Species Abundance), and a rabund_ (Relative Abundance) file.

.. _list: https://mothur.org/wiki/list_file/
.. _rabund: https://mothur.org/wiki/rabund_file/
.. _sabund: https://mothur.org/wiki/sabund_file/
.. _phylotype: https://mothur.org/wiki/phylotype/

    ]]></help>
    <expand macro="citations"/>
</tool>
